      "subject": "Geography",
      "title": "Largest Oil Reserves",
      "path": "Geography/Fossil_Fuels/Largest_Oil_Reserves.md",
      "format": "MD",
      "bytes": 2591,
      "url": "https://github.com/madhurimarawat/UPSC-Notes-Resources/blob/3e9d46ce703ce18b9a161ca4b8819f789f31de46/Geography/Fossil_Fuels/Largest_Oil_Reserves.md",
      "text": "## 🌍 Largest Oil Reserves **by Continent** *(OPEC data)*\r\n\r\n### 🌎 **North America**\r\n\r\n1. **Canada** 🇨🇦 – **~168 billion barrels** *(mostly oil sands)*\r\n2. United States 🇺🇸 – **~69 billion barrels**\r\n3. Mexico 🇲🇽 – **~6 billion barrels**\r\n\r\n➡ **Largest in North America:** **Canada**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🌎 **South America**\r\n\r\n1. **Venezuela** 🇻🇪 – **~303 billion barrels**\r\n2. Brazil 🇧🇷 – **~13 billion barrels**\r\n3. Ecuador 🇪🇨 – **~8 billion barrels**\r\n\r\n➡ **Largest in South America:** **Venezuela**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🌍 **Asia**\r\n\r\n1. **Saudi Arabia** 🇸🇦 – **~267 billion barrels**\r\n2. **Iran** 🇮🇷 – **~209 billion barrels**\r\n3. **Iraq** 🇮🇶 – **~145 billion barrels**\r\n4. **Kuwait** 🇰🇼 – **~101 billion barrels**\r\n\r\n➡ **Largest in Asia:** **Saudi Arabia**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🌍 **Africa**\r\n\r\n1. **Libya** 🇱🇾 – **~48 billion barrels**\r\n2. **Nigeria** 🇳🇬 – **~37 billion barrels**\r\n3. **Algeria** 🇩🇿 – **~12 billion barrels**\r\n\r\n➡ **Largest in Africa:** **Libya**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🌍 **Europe**\r\n\r\n1. **Russia** 🇷🇺 – **~80 billion barrels** *(includes European & Asian Russia)*\r\n2. **Norway** 🇳🇴 – **~8 billion barrels**\r\n\r\n➡ **Largest in Europe:** **Russia**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🌏 **Australia / Oceania**\r\n\r\n1. **Australia** 🇦🇺 – **~4 billion barrels**\r\n\r\n➡ **Largest in Oceania:** **Australia**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 🏆 **Largest Oil Reserves in the World (Overall)** *(OPEC-aligned)*\r\n\r\n| Rank | Country               | Proven Oil Reserves  |\r\n| ---- | --------------------- | -------------------- |\r\n| 🥇 1 | **Venezuela** 🇻🇪    | ~303 billion barrels |\r\n| 🥈 2 | **Saudi Arabia** 🇸🇦 | ~267 billion barrels |\r\n| 🥉 3 | **Iran** 🇮🇷         | ~209 billion barrels |\r\n| 4    | **Canada** 🇨🇦       | ~168 billion barrels |\r\n| 5    | **Iraq** 🇮🇶         | ~145 billion barrels |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 🔑 **Quick Takeaways (Prelims-Ready)**\r\n\r\n* 🌍 **World’s largest proven oil reserves:** **Venezuela**\r\n* 🌏 **Most oil-rich continent:** **Asia**\r\n* 🛢️ **OPEC countries hold ~79% of global oil reserves**\r\n* 🇨🇦 Canada’s high ranking is due to **oil sands**, not conventional crude\r\n* 🇻🇪 Venezuela’s reserves are mainly **extra-heavy crude (Orinoco Belt)**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### 📚 **Primary Source**\r\n\r\n* Wikipedia (compiled from OPEC, BP Statistical Review):\r\n  🔗 [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_countries_by_proven_oil_reserves](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_countries_by_proven_oil_reserves)",
